# - @kintsugi/oscillate (process altitude) — the load-bearing
#   binding. Per family-root `shards/song.mirror:181`: oscillate's
#   ACTIVE/DARK alternation IS the beat. One beat = one
#   @kintsugi/oscillate.pulse at song altitude. The species's `strike`
#   action dispatches to @kintsugi/oscillate.oscillate driver;
#   `hold` skips the pulse but advances @time.tick.
#
# - @song/phrase (sibling altitude) — the compositional parent.
#   Per phrase.mirror `6b9bc5c` §"OBC binding closure": a phrase
#   carries ONE OBC's ambiguity-load budget within a bounded temporal
#   envelope. A phrase IS a sequence of beats composed under the
#   phrase's OBC boundary; each beat's `strike` consumes one increment
#   of the phrase's ambiguity-load budget; the phrase closes when the
#   beat sequence exhausts the budget at Splinter-pole (authentic
#   cadence) OR the budget is violated at Narcissus-pole (OBC boundary
#   collapse).
#
# - @dance (multi-peer altitude) — the coordination-without-signal
#   binding per Mara `4f079c8` canonical spec + Reed `61b444a` Path C
#   annotations. Multiple peers phase-lock at shared beat frequency
#   via Kuramoto coupling; the beat IS the shared temporal unit
#   across the peer ensemble; @resonance (per Mara `9e48710`) shapes
#   Fate tournaments toward basins at the beat altitude (Kuramoto
#   ω_i per @silicon coupling); Aumann-agreement fires when the
#   ensemble's cybernetic_coherence deltas converge at shared
#   root_OID (per Reed `8e6e517` @coherence annotation).
#
# === Path-namespace pact per @epistemologic/pact/path_matches_namespace ===
